# Copy to .env and set your PC's LAN IP when using Expo Go on a physical phone.
# Find your IP: ipconfig (Windows) — look for IPv4 on your Wi‑Fi adapter.
# Phone and PC must be on the same Wi‑Fi network.
#
# IMPORTANT: Port must match the backend terminal (4000, 4001, … if 4000 is busy).
# The app also auto-probes ports 4000–4011 on the same host at startup.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.4:4000/api
